`packaging/linux/test_install.py` (6 tests, disposable binaries and temp prefixes, never the real profile), run by the Packaging lint workflow:

- install, then update over an existing install (other apps' files under `share/` are kept);
- launch through `gio launch` from a prefix with spaces and special characters (skipped where `gio` is absent);
- bad arguments and refused prefixes;
- incomplete bundle;
- `--help`;
